<http://data.silknow.org/object/d02e581c-61d8-32a6-80b5-76b799e8746f/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Square central compartment with motif of two men, in profile, carrying a bar across their shoulders which supports a large grape bunch. (Caleb and Jacob returning from the Promised Land). Border of bands with Dutch names. Flanked by several rows of two and three letters. Repeating floral grouping in a basket and reindeer motives, surrounded by characteristic cross-like designs. Date apears in corner beneath a crown. Polychrome silk yarns, in various stitches, on a cream colored cotton ground. Slightly soiled."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/d02e581c-61d8-32a6-80b5-76b799e8746f> .

